CM_ "BMW F11 520d DDE FlexRay frames, reverse engineered (Fred's analysis). Message ID = FlexRay slot ID. Byte 0 = cycle count, bytes 1.. = payload, as SavvyCAN decodes FlexRay frames. E2E: CRC8 poly 0x1D init 0 xorout 0 XOR per-group K, see f11_dde_e2e.md. Generated by make_flexray_dbc.py; edit the CSV, not this file.";
CM_ BU_ DDE "Engine ECU, FlexRay node 0x12, coldstart sync node (sync frame 0x3D).";
CM_ BU_ VEHICLE "Rest of the FlexRay cluster.";
CM_ BO_ 190 "DDE FlexRay slot 0xbe. payload 4/10/16/32 B in sporadic. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 104 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x68. payload 2 B in c0/c3/c7 mod 8; ~0.2/s. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 266 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x10a. payload 4 B in base2/rep8; ~1 s. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 92 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x5c. payload 8 B in base1/rep16 (DDE share). DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 322 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x142. payload 30 B in c0/c1/c2 mod 4; ~47/s. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 251 "DDE FlexRay slot 0xfb. payload 6 B in L7: c2/c6 mod 8; 200 ms; payload 4 B in L5: c5 mod 8; ~5 s; payload 8 B in L9: c3/c7 mod 8; ~5 s + event. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 232 "DDE FlexRay slot 0xe8. payload 8 B in L9: odd cycles; ~1 s, ~15/s while running; payload 4 B in L5: c0 mod 8; ~5 s. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 230 "DDE FlexRay slot 0xe6. payload 8 B in mostly c2 mod 4; ~1 s + on change. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 61 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x3d. payload 16 B in c3 (base3/rep4); 0x3D is a sync frame. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 41 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x29. payload 16 B in c3 (base3/rep4). DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 40 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x28. payload 16 B in c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1); payload 16 B in c3 (cycle mod 4 = 3). DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ BO_ 38 "DDE FlexRay slot 0x26. payload 16 B in c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. DLC = largest payload + 1 (byte 0 = cycle).";
CM_ SG_ 38 CRC_group1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. E2E CRC8 poly 0x1D init 0 xorout 0 over payload 1..3, XOR K=0xA8. SavvyCAN data[1]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 38 Counter_group1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. Low nibble 0..14 (15 never used), +1 per transmission, starts at 1 each wake. SavvyCAN data[2]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 38 CounterHi_group1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. Fixed high nibble 0xF; inside the CRC span. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 38 TurbineSpeed "Confidence: medium-high. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. SavvyCAN data[3..4]. raw-2000; 2000 (=0) when stopped. Turbine meaning inferred from behaviour (~rpm in P, ~150 R / ~350 D at creep with brake). EGS data re-packed by the DDE. Evidence: ptcan1: equal to EGS PT-CAN2 0x1AF d3..4 (r 1.000, 0x1AF leads ~8 ms); obd1/obd2: rpm-related, NOT equal to PID 0x0C (idle bias -56 rpm); R/D test";
CM_ SG_ 38 Unused_0 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. SavvyCAN data[5..16]. Always FF; not in CRC span. Evidence: all logs";
CM_ SG_ 38 Unused_1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (base1/rep4); nulls in other cycles. SavvyCAN data[5..16]. Always FF; not in CRC span. Evidence: all logs";
CM_ SG_ 40 CRC_group1_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). E2E CRC8 poly 0x1D init 0 xorout 0 over payload 1..7, XOR K=0x6A. SavvyCAN data[1]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 Counter_group1_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). Low nibble 0..14 (15 never used), +1 per transmission, starts at 1 each wake. SavvyCAN data[2]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 CounterHi_group1_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). Fixed high nibble 0xF; inside the CRC span. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 EngineTorque1_c1 "Confidence: high (field) / hint (unit). Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[3] + low nibble data[4]. Scale/offset from a public hint; ~232 at crank, 25..50 idle, about -35 engine off. Evidence: ptcan1: equal to CAN 0x0A5 bits16..27 (r 0.999 slope 1.0, same PDU)";
CM_ SG_ 40 EngineTorque2_c1 "Confidence: medium. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN high nibble data[4] + data[5]. Same format as torque 1; role unknown. Evidence: ptcan1: equal to CAN 0x0A5 bits28..39";
CM_ SG_ 40 EngineSpeed_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[6..7]. FR 25..145 ms behind OBD reply. Evidence: obd1 + obd2: OBD PID 0x0C r 0.9998 (88..92 % exact in request window); ptcan1: = CAN 0x0A5 d5..6";
CM_ SG_ 40 Byte7_const_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[8]. Constant 0xF1; inside CRC span. Evidence: all logs";
CM_ SG_ 40 CRC_group2_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). E2E CRC8 poly 0x1D init 0 xorout 0 over payload 9..15, XOR K=0xD7. SavvyCAN data[9]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 Counter_group2_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). Low nibble 0..14 (15 never used), +1 per transmission, starts at 1 each wake. SavvyCAN data[10]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 CounterHi_group2_c1 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). Fixed high nibble 0x1 (0x3 for ~60..80 ms at crank); inside the CRC span. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
CM_ SG_ 40 AccelPedal_c1 "Confidence: high (field) / hint (scale). Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[11] + low nibble data[12]. 0 throughout the drive (refutes earlier brake idea). No OBD pedal PID logged. Evidence: ptcan1 3krev: = CAN 0x0D9 bits16..27 (r 0.9998 slope 1.001)";
CM_ SG_ 40 AccelPedal2_c1 "Confidence: medium. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[13] + low nibble data[14]. Second pedal/throttle-like value. Evidence: ptcan1 3krev vs 0x0D9 (r 0.989)";
CM_ SG_ 40 Raw_14_15_c1 "Confidence: undecoded. Cycles: c1 (cycle mod 4 = 1). SavvyCAN data[15..16]. Inside CRC span. Evidence: ign-on constant 7F C0";
