CM_ SG_ 40 Counter_group1_c3 "Confidence: confirmed. Cycles: c3 (cycle mod 4 = 3). Low nibble 0..14 (15 never used), +1 per transmission, starts at 1 each wake. SavvyCAN data[2]. Evidence: dde_e2e.md: 5 MITM logs + non-MITM ignon, 100 %; ptcan1 3 logs 100 %; ts run 4 100 %";
